@startuml
' Claim states set by the email intake. Keep in sync with docs/design/email-claim-intake.md (Claim states).
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #F5F7FA
skinparam StateBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
hide empty description

title Claim states set by the email intake

state "Pending Information" as PI
state "Pending Review" as PR
state "In Process" as IP

[*] --> PI : new claim email,\ndetails missing
[*] --> PR : new claim email,\ndetails complete

PI --> PI : customer reply,\ndetails still missing
PI --> PR : customer reply\ncompletes the details

PR --> PR : customer reply, details still complete\n(waiting run cancelled, a new one waits)
PR --> PI : customer reply leaves details missing\n(waiting run cancelled)
PR --> PI : claims processor:\nNeeds more information
PR --> IP : claims processor:\nReady

note right of IP
  Pending = Pending Information or Pending Review.
  A claim in any other status (e.g. New, In Process,
  Processed, Denied) only gets a status answer
  and is never updated. Intake never sets New.
end note
@enduml
